{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>Therefore.</b> On account of that war that Sihon waged against Moab." "<b>The proverbs say.</b> Balaam — for it is said of him, ״וַיִּשָּׂא מְשָׁלוֹ״ (Numbers 23)." "<b>The proverbs.</b> Balaam and Beor, and they said:" "<b>Come to Heshbon.</b> That Sihon could not conquer it, and he went and hired Balaam to curse it (Tanchuma); and this is what Balak said to him, ״כִּי יָדַעְתִּי אֵת אֲשֶׁר תְּבָרֵךְ מְבֹרָךְ״ etc. (Numbers 22)." "<b>Let it be built and established.</b> Heshbon, in the name of Sihon, to be his city."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:12:04.468478538Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}